	(text "Description:\nesp32 based macropad. a good testing platform for v1 of the firmware\nand printing\n\nAssumptions:\nPower comming to the JST connector is already regulated\nthis is not a focus at this point in the project\n\nAfter proof of concept, power and charging will be handled\non the board\n\n\nObjective:\nSimple desing and easy assembly (hence easy debugging)\nPossible to make by CNC Milling\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 178.816 0)
		(effects
